-- Livestock Registry — the animal and event lines for the records seeded in
-- 10_farmers_livestock.sql. Every line links straight to its livestock record
-- (link_internal_record_id) and names its animal by ear tag, mirroring how the
-- livestock module's one2many lines hang off g2p.livestock.registry.
--
-- Ear tags are ET-<region>-<holding><serial>, so a tag identifies its region and
-- holding on sight. Vaccine batch numbers follow the National Veterinary
-- Institute (Bishoftu) format. The health, vaccination, vital and breeding lines
-- are consistent with each other and with the animals they reference: the
-- quarantined Afar goat has the notifiable PPR case, the overdue Menz ewe missed
-- the spring campaign, the deceased goat has the mortality event, and the Horro
-- cow's successful breeding matches its calving.

